{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_14_title", "source_sha256": "163b00ba1de1c6630745bc6e512756d337b8486450fdd3d96117dd1057f7f00e", "ja": "幕が降りて…", "zh": "拉下帷幕……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_14_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c3fae6c2edd5b2f728cc7e930d7d98d7e8988d930aade374cd0f478b71379100", "ja": "楽しい時間は、あっという間だった。ファン\nの歓声は鳴りやまない。バックステージの社\n長、小鳥、美咲も感動している。社長はプロ\nデューサーを称え、小鳥と美咲もサポートを\n約束、みんなで劇場に帰るのだった。", "zh": "欢乐的时光转瞬即逝。粉丝\n们的欢呼声久久不息。后台的社\n长、音无小鸟和青羽美咲也深受感动。社长称\n赞了制作人，小鸟和美咲也约定会继续支持，\n大家一起回到了剧场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_14_1000_null", "source_sha256": "6eabc4cac68c99e00f7e3b28c622556309f0524f2523639987f50945d2e80bc7", "ja": "ワアアアアア……！", "zh": "哗啊啊啊啊啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_14_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "e9dca8103f72cf6b3e3c69399c78c8d0e0d5d68de9968a53329ad81bce91fdc7", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん！\nファンの人達の歓声が、止まりません！", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生！\n粉丝们的欢呼声，完全停不下来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_14_1002_president", "source_sha256": "310a9fbee5641d8833de675660c913a1ca12ee6b9189d66e3948fc23b9ce8452", "ja": "うむ。この凄まじい熱気！　ファンの皆も、\nアイドル諸君の成長を感じたに違いない。", "zh": "嗯，这股惊人的热情！粉丝们也一定感受到了各位偶像的成长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_14_1003_101kot", "source_sha256": "57492a98458362d7e5353747c68925787ee1ad757add80d613caa3ddc20068b5", "ja": "1曲目のイントロが流れた瞬間から、\n本当にすごい盛り上がりでしたものね！", "zh": "从第1首歌的前奏响起的那一刻起，\n现场气氛就真的热烈得不得了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_14_1004_101kot", "source_sha256": "b7f8fd0fd53be65296df7851ee523bff8bd3c289fe180681fc4432a0a1aafb80", "ja": "私なんて、最初の曲から目頭が熱くなってしまって……\nいま思い出すだけでも、もう……！　ううっ……。", "zh": "我呢，从第一首歌开始眼眶就热了起来……现在光是回想起来，就已经……！呜呜……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_14_1005_president", "source_sha256": "649ab637596f99a55189501ff6fc260f2f8949054beddddffb1c863c37bf4f8b", "ja": "音無君もか……いやはや、私も同じでね。\n我々も歳をとったという事なのかもしれないな。", "zh": "音无也是吗……哎呀呀，其实我也一样。或许这就说明我们也上年纪了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_14_1006_101kot", "source_sha256": "f69debf11abac30e4299b23dbc817554b84195774e2d1dea24de1ab411cbc699", "ja": "ピヨッ！？　な、何だか聞き捨てならない言葉が……\n私はまだ、ピチピチですからね！？", "zh": "啾！？这、这话可不能当作没听见……\n我还年轻着呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_14_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "ecb431b328bb67cef75fd0cdaf9185b5977a5e33fd1c7197a62dd630d10835ae", "ja": "私も、みんなのパフォーマンスにじーんとしちゃって\n……お仕事なのに、最後まで見入ってました。", "zh": "我也被大家的表演感动得鼻子一酸……明明是工作，却一直看到最后入了迷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_14_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "b1c0defd4a4097fa48f5a7911312cfa37e5aecd63908f3455291b7144b4087ea", "ja": "あんなに素敵なステージを……すごいなぁ。私も、\nそのお手伝いができたんだと思うと、うれしいです♪", "zh": "那么精彩的舞台……真厉害啊。我也能为这样的演出尽一份力，想到这里就觉得很开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_14_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "a5bfb24696b1239aac5b5ccc3ad7f88d28f74ccd2f0d29fc0b11f35bd2a044c7", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、どうでしたか？\nみんなの努力と成長……いっぱい感じましたか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生觉得怎么样？\n有没有充分感受到大家的努力与成长呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_14_1010_president", "source_sha256": "360890752729230f6f4c222f0c3d84529e7a1d9d163a1649b2a224fdbdd3a340", "ja": "いいんだよ？　立派に成長したアイドル諸君を見て、\n号泣しても！　私でよければ、胸を貸そうか？", "zh": "没关系的哦？看着茁壮成长起来的偶像们，\n大哭一场也无妨！不介意的话，我的胸膛借你靠靠？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_14_1011_101kot", "source_sha256": "295e3a5bc61c9fef382bb4385453eb02ee1f9a8a196ee8cb8e3960993a863b15", "ja": "ええっ！　しゃ、社長が{$P$}さんに\n……ハッ！　ダメよ！　いけないわ、小鳥……！", "zh": "啊！董、董事长要向{$P$}先生……啊！不行！不可以，小鸟……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_14_1012_president", "source_sha256": "b056a75c8fe84dafc5d9b8ebefdd50c67defdb81ba2902aefe6754e5bad7536b", "ja": "大きなステージを最後まで務めあげられたのも、\nアイドル諸君と君の、強固な信頼関係があればこそ！", "zh": "能够圆满完成大舞台的演出，\n正是多亏了偶像们与你之间那份坚不可摧的信任！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_14_1013_president", "source_sha256": "5d6660633236e9fe284944471721ee332d2ffd24e64d5800792b2663bd6a5b19", "ja": "これからも引き続き、彼女たちの未来を\n照らし続けるプロデュース、よろしく頼むよ！", "zh": "今后也请继续制作人，为她们的未来照亮前路！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_14_1014_101kot", "source_sha256": "b711e60ac915877e6a7c17a5976b0b55fe1914a5f9451306d64230a9481a9f49", "ja": "私も美咲ちゃんと一緒に、しっかりサポートしますね！\n……ところで。", "zh": "我也会和美咲一起好好支持大家的！……不过话说回来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_14_1015_101kot", "source_sha256": "d45350ed7f6e4671c260924f593750c4758b1e968e266d5768a8f702fd1bc98b", "ja": "野外ステージという新しい挑戦も素敵ですけど……\nそろそろ、劇場が恋しくなってきちゃいましたね？", "zh": "户外舞台这一全新的挑战确实很棒……不过，我们也差不多开始想念剧场了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_14_1016_president", "source_sha256": "1ebf4d1eda943908a74a2c33bafc8e0b02f082769a43d1d5c97d3f65a0ab978d", "ja": "うむ。疲れた体を癒やすには、やはりホームが一番！\n帰ろうじゃないか、我々のホームへ！", "zh": "嗯。要治愈疲惫的身体，果然还是回到主场最好！回去吧，回到我们的主场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_14_1017_102mis", "source_sha256": "2b01b58592bce4e1206d04ad683192a4b959c687159f8fd7f489b6b094afa921", "ja": "はい！　アイドルのみんなも支度ができたみたいですし\n……私たちの劇場に、みんなで帰りましょうね♪", "zh": "好的！偶像们似乎也都准备好了……\n我们一起回到属于我们的剧场吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
